  },
  "promise": {
   "es": "prometer; promesa",
   "pron": "PRÓ-mis"
  }
 },
 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Will + verbo base",
    "@en": "Will + verb base"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Will** + verbo sin «to»: **It will rain** (lloverá), **I will call you** (te llamaré). Es igual para todas las personas: **I will**, **she will**, **we will**.",
     "@en": "**Will** + verb without «to»: **It will rain** (rain), **I will call you** (call you). It's the same for all people: **I will**, **she will**, **we will**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Negativa: **won't** (will not): **I won't be late** (no llegaré tarde).",
     "@en": "Negative: **won't** (will not): **I won't be late** (I will not be late)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Opiniones y predicciones",
    "@en": "Opinions and predictions"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Will** sirve para expresar una opinión o hacer una predicción: a menudo va después de **I think** (creo que) o **I believe** (creo que): **I believe it will rain on Monday** (creo que lloverá el lunes).",
     "@en": "**Will** serves to express an opinion or make a prediction: it often goes after **I think** (I think) or **I believe** (I think): **I believe it will rain on Monday** (I think it will rain on Monday)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Probably, maybe, soon, later",
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Probably** suele ir entre **will** y el verbo: **It will probably rain**. **Maybe** suele ir al principio: **Maybe it will be sunny**. **Soon** (pronto) y **later** (más tarde) pueden ir al final: **I will call you soon**.",
     "@en": "**Probably** usually goes between **will** and the verb: **It will probably rain**. **Maybe** usually goes to the beginning: **Maybe it will be sunny**. **Soon** (soon) and **later** (later) can go to the end: **I will call you soon**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "vocabulario",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Vocabulario: futuro",
    "@en": "Vocabulary: future"
   },
   "palabras": [
    "will",
    "won't",
    "probably",
    "maybe",
    "sure",
    "believe",
    "soon",
    "later",
    "next",
    "sunny",
    "forecast",
    "promise"
   ]
  },
  {
